NoticeViews::handshakeView - sequence rendering (view def SequenceView)

part caller
part callee

messages:
  caller => caller: echo
  caller => callee: of Ping

not represented:
  - attribute def Kit::Level has no place in a sequence rendering; it is not shown
  - a connect in Talk::Handshake states no direction; a sequence rendering shows directed messages only
  - message pending states no source and target; no message is drawn
  - message adrift attaches to monitor.tapped, which is on no lifeline the rendering shows; no message is drawn
